# Allow-list for container builds from the repo root (docker/mipcc27/Dockerfile).
# Everything is excluded except what the wheel and the image are built from, so
# local build trees (target/), test data and scratch files never enter the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!crates/
!python/discopt/
!docker/mipcc27/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.so
**/target
